msgctxt "CSP status"
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Desactivada"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php includes/class-ash-admin.php
msgid "Content Security Policy is being sent with responses."
msgstr "La Content Security Policy se envía con las respuestas."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php includes/class-ash-admin.php
msgid "Content Security Policy is currently turned off."
msgstr "La Content Security Policy está desactivada en este momento."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Configure each HTTP security header and the values sent with responses."
msgstr ""
"Configure cada cabecera de seguridad HTTP y los valores enviados con las "
"respuestas."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Deprecated / Legacy"
msgstr "Obsoleto / heredado"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Legacy browser XSS filter. Modern browsers ignore this header; prefer "
"Content-Security-Policy."
msgstr ""
"Filtro XSS de navegadores antiguos. Los navegadores modernos ignoran esta "
"cabecera; use Content-Security-Policy."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable X-XSS-Protection"
msgstr "Activar X-XSS-Protection"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Send the X-XSS-Protection header with the selected policy."
msgstr "Envía la cabecera X-XSS-Protection con la política seleccionada."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Policy"
msgstr "Política"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Choose the legacy XSS filter policy sent to older browsers."
msgstr ""
"Elija la política del filtro XSS heredado que se envía a los navegadores "
"antiguos."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Reporting URL"
msgstr "URL de informes"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Endpoint that receives XSS filter reports when the report policy is "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"Endpoint que recibe los informes del filtro XSS cuando se elige la política "
"report."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"The default policy is 0, which turns the legacy filter off when the header "
"is sent."
msgstr ""
"La política predeterminada es 0 e inhabilita el filtro heredado al enviar la"
" cabecera."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Prevents browsers from MIME-sniffing a response away from the declared "
"content type."
msgstr "Impide que el navegador adivine un tipo MIME distinto del declarado."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable X-Content-Type-Options"
msgstr "Activar X-Content-Type-Options"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"When enabled, the plugin always sends nosniff. There are no additional "
"options."
msgstr ""
"Si está activado, el plugin siempre envía nosniff. No hay más opciones."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "When enabled, always send X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff."
msgstr "Si está activado, siempre se envía X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "1 Day"
msgstr "1 día"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "1 Week"
msgstr "1 semana"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "1 Month"
msgstr "1 mes"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "6 Months"
msgstr "6 meses"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "1 Year"
msgstr "1 año"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "2 Years"
msgstr "2 años"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Custom value"
msgstr "Valor personalizado"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Forces browsers to use HTTPS for future requests to this host."
msgstr ""
"Obliga a los navegadores a usar HTTPS en futuras peticiones a este host."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable Strict-Transport-Security"
msgstr "Activar Strict-Transport-Security"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Instruct browsers to use HTTPS for this host for the configured lifetime."
msgstr ""
"Indica a los navegadores que usen HTTPS en este host durante el tiempo "
"configurado."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "How long browsers should remember to use HTTPS only."
msgstr "Cuánto tiempo deben recordar los navegadores usar solo HTTPS."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Custom max-age (seconds)"
msgstr "max-age personalizado (segundos)"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enter max-age in seconds."
msgstr "Introduzca max-age en segundos."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Include Subdomains"
msgstr "Incluir subdominios"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Adds includeSubDomains so the policy also applies to subdomains."
msgstr ""
"Añade includeSubDomains para que la política también se aplique a los "
"subdominios."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Preload"
msgstr "Preload"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Adds preload. Requires includeSubDomains and a max-age of at least one year."
msgstr ""
"Añade preload. Requiere includeSubDomains y un max-age de al menos un año."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"This header is sent only over HTTPS. Preload requires includeSubDomains and "
"max-age of at least 31536000."
msgstr ""
"Esta cabecera solo se envía por HTTPS. Preload exige includeSubDomains y un "
"max-age de al menos 31536000."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Restricts access to powerful browser features such as camera and "
"geolocation."
msgstr ""
"Restringe el acceso a funciones sensibles del navegador, como cámara y "
"geolocalización."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable Permissions-Policy"
msgstr "Activar Permissions-Policy"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Control which origins may use powerful browser features."
msgstr "Controla qué orígenes pueden usar funciones sensibles del navegador."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Directives"
msgstr "Directivas"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Custom Directives"
msgstr "Directivas personalizadas"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Add feature names that are not listed above. Directives set to Not Set are "
"omitted from the header."
msgstr ""
"Añada nombres de funciones que no aparecen arriba. Las directivas en No "
"definido no se incluyen en la cabecera."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Directive name"
msgstr "Nombre de la directiva"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Add directive"
msgstr "Añadir directiva"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Directives configured as Not Set, or with Enable Directive turned off, are "
"not included in the generated header."
msgstr ""
"Las directivas en No definido, o con Activar directiva desactivado, no se "
"incluyen en la cabecera generada."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Controls whether the site can be embedded in frames to reduce clickjacking "
"risk."
msgstr ""
"Controla si el sitio puede incrustarse en frames para reducir el "
"clickjacking."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable X-Frame-Options"
msgstr "Activar X-Frame-Options"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Control whether the site may be embedded in frames."
msgstr "Controla si el sitio puede incrustarse en frames."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"DENY blocks all framing. SAMEORIGIN allows framing by this origin only. "
"ALLOW-FROM is obsolete and is not offered."
msgstr ""
"DENY bloquea todo el framing. SAMEORIGIN solo permite este origen. ALLOW-"
"FROM está obsoleto y no se ofrece."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "The default policy is SAMEORIGIN."
msgstr "La política predeterminada es SAMEORIGIN."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "privacy/security sensitive"
msgstr "sensible para la privacidad/seguridad"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Limits referrer information sent with navigations and resource requests."
msgstr ""
"Limita la información de referrer enviada en navegaciones y peticiones de "
"recursos."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable Referrer-Policy"
msgstr "Activar Referrer-Policy"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Control how much referrer information is sent with requests."
msgstr "Controla cuánta información de referrer se envía con las solicitudes."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Choose the Referrer-Policy value sent with responses."
msgstr "Elija el valor de Referrer-Policy enviado con las respuestas."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "unsafe-url sends the full URL across origins and is privacy-sensitive."
msgstr ""
"unsafe-url envía la URL completa entre orígenes y es sensible para la "
"privacidad."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "The default policy is strict-origin-when-cross-origin."
msgstr "La política predeterminada es strict-origin-when-cross-origin."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable Directive"
msgstr "Activar directiva"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Include this directive in the generated Permissions-Policy header."
msgstr "Incluye esta directiva en la cabecera Permissions-Policy generada."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Eliminar"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Choose how this feature may be used."
msgstr "Elija cómo puede usarse esta función."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Custom Origins"
msgstr "Orígenes personalizados"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"One origin per line. Use self or full origins such as https://example.com."
msgstr ""
"Un origen por línea. Use self u orígenes completos como https://example.com."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Not Set"
msgstr "No definido"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Deny All"
msgstr "Denegar todo"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Self"
msgstr "Self"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Allow All"
msgstr "Permitir todo"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php includes/class-ash-admin.php
msgid "Security Features"
msgstr "Funciones de seguridad"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Configure WordPress hardening without turning off legitimate site features "
"by default."
msgstr ""
"Configure el refuerzo de WordPress sin desactivar por defecto funciones "
"legitimas del sitio."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Hides server technology details exposed by the X-Powered-By header."
msgstr ""
"Oculta los detalles de tecnología del servidor que expone X-Powered-By."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable Remove X-Powered-By Header"
msgstr "Activar eliminar cabecera X-Powered-By"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"When enabled, the plugin removes the X-Powered-By response header. There are"
" no additional options."
msgstr ""
"Cuando esta activado, el plugin quita la cabecera de respuesta X-Powered-By."
" No hay opciónes adicionales."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"WordPress exposes generator information in HTML, RSS, Atom, and RDF output."
msgstr ""
"WordPress expone información generator en la salida HTML, RSS, Atom y RDF."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable Hide WordPress Version"
msgstr "Activar ocultar la version de WordPress"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Turn on WordPress version hiding, then choose which generator outputs to "
"remove."
msgstr ""
"Active el ocultamiento de la version de WordPress y luego elija que salidas "
"generator se quitan."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Hide Generator Meta Version"
msgstr "Ocultar la version del meta generator"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Removes the generator meta tag from HTML output."
msgstr "Quita la etiqueta meta generator de la salida HTML."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Hide Version from RSS / Atom / RDF Feeds"
msgstr "Ocultar la version en los feeds RSS / Atom / RDF"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Removes generator version strings from RSS, Atom, and RDF feeds."
msgstr ""
"Quita las cadenas de version del generator de los feeds RSS, Atom y RDF."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Version query parameters are not removed from CSS or JavaScript assets, so "
"cache busting keeps working."
msgstr ""
"No se quitan los parametros de version de los recursos CSS o JavaScript, "
"para que el cache busting siga funcionando."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Generic Error"
msgstr "Error genérico"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Hide Error Completely"
msgstr "Ocultar el error por completo"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Custom Error Message"
msgstr "Mensaje de error personalizado"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Stop login failure responses from revealing whether a username or email "
"address exists."
msgstr ""
"Evite que las respuestas de error de acceso revelen si existe un nombre de "
"usuario o un correo."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable Login Error Protection"
msgstr "Activar proteccion de errores de acceso"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Only authentication failure messages are changed. Informational and "
"successful login messages are left alone."
msgstr ""
"Solo se modifican los mensajes de error de autenticación. Los mensajes "
"informativos y de acceso correcto no se tocan."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Error Mode"
msgstr "Modo de error"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Choose how authentication failure messages are shown."
msgstr "Elija como se muestran los mensajes de error de autenticación."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "This plain-text message replaces authentication failure errors."
msgstr ""
