msgid ""
"Pingback mode blocks pingback.ping and pingback.extensions.getPingbacks. "
"Removing the X-Pingback header is recommended when pingbacks or all XML-RPC "
"methods are blocked."
msgstr ""
"El modo Pingback bloquea pingback.ping y pingback.extensions.getPingbacks. "
"Se recomienda quitar la cabecera X-Pingback cuando se bloquean los pingbacks"
" o todos los métodos XML-RPC."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Removes the X-Pingback response header from WordPress output."
msgstr ""
"Elimina la cabecera de respuesta X-Pingback de la salida de WordPress."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable Remove X-Pingback Header"
msgstr "Activar eliminar cabecera X-Pingback"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"When enabled, the plugin removes the X-Pingback header. There are no "
"additional options."
msgstr ""
"Cuando esta activado, el plugin quita la cabecera X-Pingback. No hay "
"opciónes adicionales."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"XML-RPC pingback protection or complete XML-RPC blocking is enabled. "
"Removing the X-Pingback header is recommended."
msgstr ""
"La proteccion Pingback de XML-RPC o el bloqueo completo de XML-RPC esta "
"activado. Se recomienda quitar la cabecera X-Pingback."

