#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Restricted Routes"
msgstr "Rutas restringidas"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "These routes are blocked even if the access policy would allow them."
msgstr "Estas rutas se bloquean aunque la política de acceso las permitiera."

